For an affected root Content.* project find its owner guide through [Modules/CATALOG.md](../../Modules/CATALOG.md). [Architecture](../../.agents/rules/architecture-and-ownership.md) owns layers/references and [trajectory](../../.agents/rules/fork-trajectory-priority.md) inherited placement; a module.yml is relevant only when that owner uses one. Use [module-architecture](../../.agents/skills/module-architecture/SKILL.md) for an actual access/assembly decision, not a full project inventory. In review assess the changed boundary without executing setup.
